# Task: Swap Landscape/Portrait Labels in ImageAnalyzerWindow.xaml

## 1. Context & Objective
The aspect ratio combo box in the Image Analyzer window still has inverted labels. Index 0 maps to portrait resolution (1088x1600) but is labeled "Landscape", and index 1 maps to landscape resolution (1600x1088) but is labeled "Portrait". Only the labels need swapping.

## 2. Files to Modify
- `FlipPix.UI/ImageAnalyzerWindow.xaml`: Swap the "Landscape" and "Portrait" labels in the aspect ratio combo box.

## 3. Implementation Steps

### Step 1: Swap labels in the aspect ratio ComboBox (line 409-410)
Change:
```xml
<ComboBoxItem Content="Landscape"/>
<ComboBoxItem Content="Portrait"/>
```
To:
```xml
<ComboBoxItem Content="Portrait"/>
<ComboBoxItem Content="Landscape"/>
```

**Important:** Do NOT modify any workflow files, C# view models, or resolution mappings. Only swap the two label strings in the XAML file.

## 4. Completion Instructions
Update this file with a "Changelog" section detailing your changes for my review.

